                  </button>
      </h3>
      <div role="region" aria-labelledby="bde-faq-130-button-1" id="bde-faq-130-1" class="bde-faq__answer">
        <div class="bde-faq__answer-content">
            <div class="breakdance-rich-text-styles"><p>NBA salary data is spread across trackers, team announcements and news reports, and most sites show a number without saying what it means. NBA Salaries puts each contract in context: how it compares with the team's payroll, the salary cap and the rest of the league.</p></div>

                    </div>
      </div>
    </div>
      <div class="bde-faq__item">
      <h3 class="bde-faq__title-tag">
       <button id="bde-faq-130-button-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="bde-faq-130-2" class="bde-faq__question js-faq-item">
          <span class="bde-faq__title">Do you have inside access to NBA contracts?</span>
