                            </div>
                  </button>
      </h3>
      <div role="region" aria-labelledby="bde-faq-130-button-2" id="bde-faq-130-2" class="bde-faq__answer">
        <div class="bde-faq__answer-content">
            <div class="breakdance-rich-text-styles"><p>No. Every figure comes from public reporting and official announcements. NBA salaries are widely reported, but details such as guarantees and options sometimes differ between sources, and the site says so when they do.</p></div>

                    </div>
      </div>
    </div>
